  "address_note": "gov.uk 'check which driving test centres you can move your test to' (rules from 9 June 2026) lists Hendon (London) as a current centre; the find-driving-test-centre service could not be reached from this machine, so the street address comes from several listings and the 2011 instructor blog. OSM puts Aviation Drive NW9 5TZ (way/146876784) at 51.59600,-0.23990, about 20 m from the given position: matches. The centre was already at this address in 2011, so no source here predates a move.",
  "mill_hill_note": "Mill Hill (London), Bunns Lane NW7 2DQ, still exists as a separate centre: the same gov.uk page lists it on its own and as about 2 miles from Hendon. It was not replaced by Hendon. Pass 1 marked the two Mill Hill instructor blogs as 'old_address' for Hendon; they are about a different, open centre, and the 2011 Hendon post (s3) is about the current Hendon address.",
